      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. But to be fair, the student's point about \"social cohesion\" is a pretty common sociological concept—the idea that shared values and identity help a society function. Are you saying that their logic is fundamentally flawed, or just that it's an outdated way of looking at things?",
